  "commit_message": "fix(runtime): see a NODE_OPTIONS-delivered user loader in the commonjs-sync guard (#742)\n\nThe `commonjs` -> `commonjs-sync` relabel declines whenever a user async ESM\nloader is active, because relabeling re-routes that module's inner require()s\nthrough the user's own resolve hook. Its detection read two signals, and an\n`--experimental-loader` delivered via NODE_OPTIONS trips neither: the flag\nregisters its loader natively so no module.register() call is observed, and\nNODE_OPTIONS entries are not",
